        },
        {
          "text": "ibindi ubirungikire umwami w’i Edomu, n’umwami w’i Mowabu, n’ umwami w’Abamoni, n’umwami w’i Tiro, n’umwami w’i Sidoni, ubirungikane intumwa zaje i Yerusalemu zitumwe kuri Zedekiya, umwami w’i Buyuda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
