        },
        {
          "text": "ubatume amajambo bashīra ba shebuja, ut’ Uku ni k’Uhoraho Nyen’ ingabo agize, ni we Mana y’Abisirayeli, at’ Uku abe ari ko mubarira ba shobuja, ",
