        },
        {
          "text": "mut’ Uhoraho agize ngo Ni jewe naremye isi, n’abantu n’ibikōko biri kw isi, mbiremesha ubushobozi bganje bginshi n’ukuboko kwanje kurāmvuye; kand’ ivyo mbigabira uwo ngomba. ",
          "type": "text",
