        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ amahanga yose azomusaba, asabe n’umwana wiwe n’umwuzukuru wiwe, gushitsa igihe co kūzirwa kw’igihugu ciwe kigeze; ni ho amahanga menshi n’abami bahambaye bazomuhindura umuja na we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ihanga ryose cank’ igihugu c’ umwami wese, ni habah’ abatemera gusaba Nebukadineza, uyo mwami w’i Babuloni, canke ngo bemere kugondera izosi ingōgo yiwe, iryo hanga nzorihana, ni k’ Uhoraho agize, ndarihanishe inkota n’inzara n’ikīza, gushitsa aho nzoba mperaheje kubaranduza ukuboko kwiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
