          "text": "ivyo Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babuloni atātwaye, igihe yajana Yekoniya mwene Yehoyakimu umwami w’i Buyuda ar’ inyagano, amukūye i Yerusalemu amujanye i Babuloni, bo n’abaganwa bose b’i Buyuda n’i Yerusalemu; ",
